From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] ntdll, kernelbase: AccessCheckByType, object ACEs, private object security, audit alarms (3735)

ntdll, kernelbase: AccessCheckByType, object ACEs, private object security, audit alarms

AccessCheckByType no longer answers "denied with success": the object ACEs
and PRINCIPAL_SELF of the DACL are resolved for the root of the object type
list and the plain check runs on the result. RtlAdd{AccessAllowed,
AccessDenied,AuditAccess}ObjectAce build the documented object ACE layouts.
RtlDefaultNpAcl returns the documented named pipe default DACL.
RtlSetInformationAcl (revision), RtlSetSecurityObject(Ex) are implemented, so
SetAclInformation and SetPrivateObjectSecurity(Ex) work.
GetWindowsAccountDomainSid fails for SIDs that are not S-1-5-21 accounts.
The audit alarm W functions require SeAuditPrivilege and report
GenerateOnClose from the SACL.
---
